{"unit_id":"Furry-wucheng__dsh-story-mode#feature-1","repo":"Furry-wucheng/dsh-story-mode","commit":"166283d48dcf6e696804da22ac6f4db3d0c1e6af","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH 短篇小说模式的功能「字数与场景目标」：按中文字符与拉丁词元规则统计稿件字数，并识别场景分隔符或标题。提供场景目标时还会报告各场景偏差；工具只读稿件。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:714-738"]}
{"unit_id":"Furry-wucheng__dsh-story-mode#feature-2","repo":"Furry-wucheng/dsh-story-mode","commit":"166283d48dcf6e696804da22ac6f4db3d0c1e6af","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH 短篇小说模式的功能「词语线索检查」：扫描引号外的指定词语线索并报告位置，供作者结合上下文复核；它不判断视角、时态或文学质量，也不会改写稿件。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:740-758"]}
{"unit_id":"Furry-wucheng__dsh-story-mode#feature-3","repo":"Furry-wucheng/dsh-story-mode","commit":"166283d48dcf6e696804da22ac6f4db3d0c1e6af","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH 短篇小说模式的功能「人物设定与词汇表检查」：解析人物卡，检查身份、动机、关系字段，并可将人物名和别名与稿件做字面提及次数核对；也可列出术语表。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:760-830"]}
{"unit_id":"Furry-wucheng__dsh-story-mode#feature-4","repo":"Furry-wucheng/dsh-story-mode","commit":"166283d48dcf6e696804da22ac6f4db3d0c1e6af","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH 短篇小说模式的功能「分层小说审读」：完整版 preset 配置五位只读审读员，精简版配置一位合并审读员，并分别挂载写作技能和文风契约。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:117-160"]}
